//! Differential harness for the Compose panel (task 5.1).
//!
//! The corpus is generated by `src/port/characterize_compose.test.ts`, which
//! renders the real `ComposePanel.tsx` with a mocked IPC layer. This test feeds
//! the same actions through the native view model with a `RecordingBackend`
//! that implements the existing `Backend` trait and logs every command call.

